trustworthiness: 1 = every 2-D neighbour is a true neighbour.
distance_spearman: rank agreement of pairwise distances (global structure).
silhouette_by_zone: > 0 means zones separate; near 0 means they overlap.

UMAP and t-SNE distances between clusters carry no quantitative meaning. Read cluster membership, not separation width. PCoA axes are linear and their spacing is interpretable.
